## Key Concepts
- At-least-once delivery
- Idempotent processing
- Append-only ledger
- Verifiable batch digests (Merkle roots)
- Regulator verification without raw inputs

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo dedupe and write to ledger
function ingest(delta, store){
  if (store.has(delta.delta_id)) return false;
  store.set(delta.delta_id, delta);
  // append to append-only ledger
  return true;
}
```

